==History==
2016
*The Ice Golem [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 14/10/2016.
*On 20/10/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (20/10/2016)|Balance Update]], allowed the Ice Golem's death damage to affect flying [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]], but Supercell called it a bug fix.
*On 1/11/2016, the [[Version History#November 2016 Update (1/11/2016)|November 2016 Update]], increased the Ice Golem's death damage by 74%. The update also changed the description. It used to read "''He's tough, targets buildings and explodes when destroyed, slowing nearby enemies. Wears a fashionable collar of coal to match his ears and nails.''". It also changed the Ice Golem's sound effects. Previously, his sound effects when deployed were identical to those of the [[Knight]].
2017
*On 23/1/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/1/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the Ice Golem's hitpoints by 5%, his death damage radius to 2 tiles (from 3 tiles), and slow effect duration to 2 seconds (from 3 seconds).
*On 13/3/2017, the [[Version History#March%202017%20Update%20(13/3/2017)|March 2017 Update]], fixed a bug when using a [[Rocket]] on 2 Ice Golems would result in the Rocket dealing double damage. It also removed the audience sound effects when the Ice Golem is deployed.
*On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]], decreased the Ice Golem‘s slow effect duration to 1 second (from 2 seconds).
2018
*On 4/6/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/6/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Ice Golem's hitpoints by 5%.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11).
2020
*On 3/2/2020, the [[Version History#Pass%20Royale%20and%20more%20(3/2/2020)|February 2020 Update]], added a card render to the Ice Golem's card info screen.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 27/6/2022, the [[Version History#Summer%202022%20Update%20(27/6/2022)|Summer 2022 Update]], changed the Ice Golem's second [[Card Mastery]] task to Collateral Damage. Previously, its second Card Mastery Task was Hit Maker.
*On 2/8/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(2/8/2022)|Balance Update]], increased the Ice Golem's slow effect duration to 1.5 seconds (from 1 second).
*On 22/12/2022, a maintenance break, changed the Ice Golem's card image.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 3/10/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/10/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the Ice Golem's slow effect duration to 2 seconds (from 1.5 seconds).
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Ice Golem's hitpoints by 0.08%.
*On 8/7/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/7/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Ice Golem's hitpoints by 10%.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] decreased the slowdown effect to -30% (from -35%).

